Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Get cities by county

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/counties/{{countyId}}/cities
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Search clients

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/clients?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Search clients by name

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/clients?name=John&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Search clients by identification number

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/clients?identifier=1980101223344&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Get client by ID

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/clients/{{clientId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Create individual client

POST {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
  "clientType": 1,
  "name": "John Doe",
  "identificationNumber": "1980101223344",
  "email": "john@test.com",
  "phone": "0712345678",
  "address": "Cluj-Napoca"
}

###

### Create company client

POST {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

