Accept: application/json

###

### Create country risk factor

POST {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/admin/risk-factors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "level": 1,
  "referenceId": "{{countryId}}",
  "adjustmentPercentage": 5.00,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create county risk factor

POST {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/admin/risk-factors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "level": 2,
  "referenceId": "{{countyId}}",
  "adjustmentPercentage": 3.00,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create city risk factor

POST {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/admin/risk-factors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "level": 3,
  "referenceId": "{{cityId}}",
  "adjustmentPercentage": 2.00,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create building type risk factor

POST {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/admin/risk-factors
