# ============================================================
# Broker - Policies
# ============================================================

### Search policies

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/policies?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Search policies by client

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/policies?clientId={{clientId}}&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Search policies by broker

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/policies?brokerId={{brokerId}}&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Search policies by status

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/policies?status=1&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Search policies by date range

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/policies?startDate=2026-10-01&endDate=2027-10-01&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Search policies with all filters

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/policies?clientId={{clientId}}&brokerId={{brokerId}}&status=1&startDate=2026-10-01&endDate=2027-10-01&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Get policy by ID

GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/policies/{{policyId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Create draft policy

POST {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/policies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
  "buildingId": "{{buildingId}}",
  "brokerId": "{{brokerId}}",
  "currencyId": "{{currencyId}}",
  "startDate": "{{policyStartDate}}",
  "endDate": "{{policyEndDate}}",
  "basePremium": {{policyBasePremium}}
}

###

### Activate policy

POST {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/brokers/policies/1c204a4e-ce66-4c17-1e15-08df29b83d57/activate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### Cancel policy

