# Policies by country

### With all filters
GET {{InsuranceApp_HostAddress}}/api/admin/reports/policies-by-country?from={{from}}&to={{to}}&status={{status}}&currency={{currency}}&buildingType={{buildingType}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### No filter
